INP_RSEV_CLS_CODE^인턴쉽예약구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
INP_RSEV_STAT_CODE^인턴쉽예약상태코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
FRST_REG_YMDH^최초등록일시^19^0^0^0^0^0^0
PLAC_CNTT^장소내용^400^0^0^0^0^0^0
PRTF_NAME^포트폴리오명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0
EMPL_NAME^직원명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="NextBlock1" inout="next" _len="51" _ulen="41" >

INP_ITEM_ID^인턴쉽항목ID^6^0^7^0^0^0^0

